[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the nchan module only.  It does not
install a loadable module, and installing it alongside nginx does not add
publish and subscribe support to a running server.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build
www/nginx, www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the HTTP_PUSH option
enabled.  Those ports pick the sources up from
%%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-nchan and produce
ngx_nchan_module.so.
EOM
}
]
